                        <i class="bi bi-calendar"></i>
                        14/08/2026
                    </span>

                    <span class="dot">•</span>

                    <span>
                        Toàn thời gian
                    </span>

                </div>

                <div class="job-bottom">

                    <p>
                        Hạn nộp:
                        <strong>31/12/2026</strong>
